id: web-browser-operator
name: Web Browser Operator
triggers: browser, website, url, search, research, web, fetch, open
description: Guides OpenClaw-style web search, fetch, and browser opening.

Use web_search for public research queries and web_fetch/read_url for a known URL.

Use browser with action=open/navigate/goto when the user asks to open a page on the laptop. Use browser with action=read/fetch when the user asks for page contents.

Be honest about current limits: OmniClaw can open/fetch pages through runtime tools, while full click/screenshot Chromium automation is still a plugin upgrade.
